  "known_remaining_product_gaps": [
    "A first new expiry observed only after the one leader clock writer returns 503 without replay; it is not mislabeled as a proved entry-time Denied 403.",
    "Other pre-plan errors such as a quota refusal are not covered by the new snapshot denial capsule.",
    "Ordinary KV X-Vault-No-Request-Forwarding plus global precision still needs an independent closed authority and metadata-only leader clock path.",
    "Listener consistency_missing_header_forward precedence still needs its independent product correction.",
    "Other non-clock maintenance states remain ineligible for this local standby snapshot path."
  ],
